to, extend to; to obtain, take possession of, possess;
to pervade, interpenetrate, fill, occupy; to fall to
one's share.

व्य्-अस्य, ind. having thrown asunder, having
thrown or tossed about, having dispersed or scattered;
having arranged in order.

. the loc. may be व्य्-अह्ने, व्य्-अहनि,
or व्य्-अह्नि), done or happening on separate days;
(according to some) done or produced in two days.

व्य्-आक्षेप, अस्, m. throwing or tossing about;
obstruction, hinderance, delay, (अ-व्याक्षेप, absence
of delay.)

व्य्-आघातक, अस्, आ or इका, अम्, striking against,
opposing, thwarting, hindering, impeding, resisting;
one who opposes or resists, an obstructor.

व्य्-आभाषित, अस्, आ, अम्, spoken to, addressed;
spoken, pronounced [cf. दुःख-व्˚]; (अम्), n. a
speech.

व्यावभाषी व्य्-आवभाषी, f. (fr. rt. भाष्
with अव, आ, and वि), mutual abuse or imprecation;
[cf. व्य्-आवक्रोशी above.]

व्य्-आवर्तन, अम्, n. the act of turning round or
away, rolling round, revolving; a volute, fold, band;
encompassing, surrounding.

व्य्-आवर्तमान, अस्, आ, अम्, becoming separated
from, keeping apart from; turning away; desisting,
ceasing; turning back.

व्य्-आविद्ध, अस्, आ, अम्, thrown or tossed about,
dishevelled; glancing or darting in all directions;
interlaced.

व्य्-आहत, अस्, आ, अम्, excessively struck at, struck
or hit back; repelled, repulsed; obstructed, impeded;
foiled, disappointed, expelled; confused, alarmed.
